+    // Small PPC helpers are extremely common (SDK getters, list helpers,
+    // audio-state probes). With native ABI + ThinLTO their argument/state
+    // marshalling often costs more than the translated body. Mark compact
+    // linked native functions always-inline so LLVM can fold guest state and
